{
    "chapter_num": 3,
    "verses_count": 21,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Mystery Revealed"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For this reason I, Paul, the prisoner of Christ Jesus for you Gentiles— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "if indeed you have heard of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "stewardship"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "dispensation of the grace of God which was given to me for you, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "how that by revelation He made known to me the mystery (as I have briefly written already, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "by which, when you read, you may understand my knowledge in the mystery of Christ), "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "which in other ages was not made known to the sons of men, as it has now been revealed by the Spirit to His holy apostles and prophets: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that the Gentiles should be fellow heirs, of the same body, and partakers of His promise in Christ through the gospel, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of which I became a minister according to the gift of the grace of God given to me by the effective working of His power."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Purpose of the Mystery"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "To me, who am less than the least of all the saints, this grace was given, that I should preach among the Gentiles the unsearchable riches of Christ, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and to make all see what "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M stewardship (dispensation)"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "fellowship of the mystery, which from the beginning of the ages has been hidden in God who created all things "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits through Jesus Christ"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "through Jesus Christ; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to the intent that now the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "variegated or many-sided"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "manifold wisdom of God might be made known by the church to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "rulers"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "principalities and powers in the heavenly "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "places,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "according to the eternal purpose which He accomplished in Christ Jesus our Lord, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "in whom we have boldness and access with confidence through faith in Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore I ask that you do not lose heart at my tribulations for you, which is your glory."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Appreciation of the Mystery"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For this reason I bow my knees to the Father "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits of our Lord Jesus Christ"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of our Lord Jesus Christ, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "from whom the whole family in heaven and earth is named, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that He would grant you, according to the riches of His glory, to be strengthened with might through His Spirit in the inner man, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that Christ may dwell in your hearts through faith; that you, being rooted and grounded in love, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "may be able to comprehend with all the saints what "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the width and length and depth and height— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to know the love of Christ which passes knowledge; that you may be filled with all the fullness of God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now to Him who is able to do exceedingly abundantly above all that we ask or think, according to the power that works in us, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to Him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " glory in the church by Christ Jesus to all generations, forever and ever. Amen."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}